- Listen & Flip (Music Recognition): Identify music playing around you directly inside SongFlip. Recognised tracks are matched to your preferred player and saved to your history.
- Offline Club Mode: No signal in a club or bar? Capture an audio fingerprint offline and let SongFlip identify the song automatically once you're back online.
- Identified Filter in History: Quickly find all recognised songs using the new "Identified" badge and filter chip in your history.
